    <bpmn:process id="W_W3417" name="W3417. Input-Cost-to-Price Pass-Through Governance &amp; SRP/Cost Adjustment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cost change (W3414); margin-plan variance (links to VS-101.3); quarterly pricing review
Frequency: Monthly/quarterly + on cost change
Volume: ~35,000 SKUs; ~40 categories
Owner: VP Merchandising
Participants: VP Merchandising, Category Managers, Pricing (links to VS-01.2/VS-57), Merchandising Finance (links to VS-101.3), Master Data (links to VS-29)
Source: workflow W3417 — Input-Cost-to-Price Pass-Through Governance &amp; SRP/Cost Adjustment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3417_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3417_Lane1" name="Category Managers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3417_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3417_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3417_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3417_Lane2" name="Merchandising Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3417_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3417_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3417_Start4" name="Cost change (W3414); margin-plan variance (links to VS-101.3); quarterly pricing review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3417_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3417_Task5" name="Category Managers/Pricing analyze the cost change (from indexed formula W3414…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Managers/Pricing analyze the cost change (from indexed formula W3414, vendor surcharge, landed cost links to VS-02.2, or hedge settlement W3413) and model the maintained-margin impact (links to VS-101 W3286); determine the pass-through decision: full pass-through, partial (absorb/share), or hold price
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Pricing
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3417_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3417_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3417_Task6" name="Category Managers/Pricing execute the SRP/cost change per VS-01.2/W40 (price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers/Pricing execute the SRP/cost change per VS-01.2/W40 (price hierarchy, authority matrix links to VS-36), update shelf labels (links to VS-08 W63/W181), ecommerce/marketplace prices (links to VS-10/VS-65/VS-95 price parity), and comply with DTI price-tag/price-freeze rules (links to VS-22/W468); respect OTB/markdown-budget controls (links to VS-101 W3283/W3285)
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Pricing / Master Data
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3417_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3417_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3417_Task7" name="Merchandising Finance track realized pass-through vs decision, measure margin…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandising Finance track realized pass-through vs decision, measure margin retention, and report commodity-driven price/cost variance to the merchandise P&amp;A (links to VS-101 W3288) and margin analytics (W3419); feed learning to the next decision
Responsible (R): Merchandising Finance / Category Managers
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3417_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3417_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3417_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3417_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3417_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-70 (ensure commodity exposure &amp; hedge accounting accuracy.) | - operational: disciplined margin modeling and competitor check (W3420); operational: competitor sensitivity (W3420)
Owner: VP Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3417_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3417_Annotation9" targetRef="W3417_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
