    <bpmn:process id="W_W3419" name="W3419. Maintained-Margin Impact Analysis &amp; Commodity Variance Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly close (links to VS-17.1/W9A); weekly P&amp;A (links to VS-101 W3288)
Frequency: Weekly + monthly
Volume: ~40 categories; ~35,000 SKUs
Owner: Merchandising Finance
Participants: Merchandising Finance, Category Managers, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Treasury (links to VS-18)
Source: workflow W3419 — Maintained-Margin Impact Analysis &amp; Commodity Variance Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3419_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3419_Lane1" name="Merchandising Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3419_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3419_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3419_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3419_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3419_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3419_Start3" name="Monthly close (links to VS-17.1/W9A); weekly P&amp;A (links to VS-101 W3288)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3419_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3419_Task4" name="Merchandising Finance decompose the maintained-margin variance (links to VS-101…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising Finance decompose the maintained-margin variance (links to VS-101 W3286) into drivers: commodity cost (W3401), FX (links to VS-18.3), freight (links to VS-06/VS-87), markdown (links to VS-101 W3285), mix, shrink (links to VS-23), and hedge outcome (W3413); isolate the commodity-driven component
Responsible (R): Merchandising Finance / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3419_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3419_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3419_Task5" name="Merchandising Finance compare realized commodity cost vs the merchandise plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandising Finance compare realized commodity cost vs the merchandise plan assumption (links to VS-101 W3281/W3286), the hedge offset (W3416), and the pass-through outcome (W3417); quantify net commodity impact on GM% and EBITDA
Responsible (R): Merchandising Finance / Treasury
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3419_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3419_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3419_Task6" name="Merchandising Finance report commodity-margin variance to the weekly P&amp;A (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandising Finance report commodity-margin variance to the weekly P&amp;A (links to VS-101 W3288), monthly finance close (links to VS-17.1), FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), and the commodity-risk review (W3423); feed to forecast reforecast (links to VS-101 W3288) and strategy adjustment (W3416)
Responsible (R): Merchandising Finance / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3419_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3419_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3419_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3419_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3419_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-70 (ensure commodity exposure &amp; hedge accounting accuracy.) | - operational: rigorous decomposition; operational: weekly cadence
Owner: Merchandising Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3419_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3419_Annotation8" targetRef="W3419_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3419_Flow10" sourceRef="W3419_Start3" targetRef="W3419_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3419_Flow11" sourceRef="W3419_Task4" targetRef="W3419_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3419_Flow12" sourceRef="W3419_Task5" targetRef="W3419_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3419_Flow13" sourceRef="W3419_Task6" targetRef="W3419_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
