      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3420_Start4" name="Pass-through decision (W3417); quarterly competitive review (links to VS-57)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3420_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3420_Task5" name="Pricing/Competitive Intelligence assess competitor pricing and pass-through…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Pricing/Competitive Intelligence assess competitor pricing and pass-through behavior on commodity-exposed categories using competitive price intelligence (links to VS-57 W130/W329) and market research (links to VS-44/VS-33.3): who has passed through, by how much, and the elasticity signal
Responsible (R): Pricing Manager / CI
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3420_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3420_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3420_Task6" name="Category Managers/Pricing model pass-through feasibility: price elasticity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers/Pricing model pass-through feasibility: price elasticity (links to VS-58 promo elasticity), volume/market-share impact, competitor retaliation risk, and the margin-vs-volume trade-off; recommend the pass-through posture per category
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Pricing
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3420_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3420_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3420_Task7" name="Pricing/Merchandising decide and execute the category pass-through posture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Pricing/Merchandising decide and execute the category pass-through posture, monitor competitor and volume response, and adjust (links to VS-57 tactical response W329); feed learning to the margin model (links to VS-101 W3286) and the next review
Responsible (R): Pricing Manager / Category Managers
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3420_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3420_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3420_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3420_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3420_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-549 (ensure controlled execution — Input-Cost Pass-Through, Margin Protection &amp; Risk Analytics (PA-106.3).) | - operational: feasibility assessment and tactical flexibility; operational: margin-vs-volume modeling
Owner: Pricing Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
