      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Market price drop not reflected in vendor price; vendor overcharge; formula asymmetry
Frequency: Continuous + periodic review
Volume: Top commodity-exposed vendors
Owner: Procurement Director
Participants: Procurement Director, Category Managers, Vendor, Finance (links to VS-15/VS-39), Legal (links to VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W3421 — Vendor Recovery / Claim &amp; Commodity Savings Capture</bpmn:documentation>
