      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3421_Task6" name="Category Managers/Procurement identify vendor-recovery opportunities: market…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Managers/Procurement identify vendor-recovery opportunities: market price drops (W3403) not passed through, formula-asymmetry overcharge, vendor invoice error vs contract (links to VS-03.3/W3411), and unclaimed savings; quantify the recovery
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Procurement
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3421_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3421_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3421_Task7" name="Procurement negotiate and claim the recovery (credit memo links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement negotiate and claim the recovery (credit memo links to VS-15.1/W7.9b, rebate/adjustment links to VS-39, contract amendment links to VS-03.3); resolve disputes (links to VS-90/W244) with Legal support (links to VS-100.3) as needed
Responsible (R): Procurement / Vendor / Legal
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Per claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3421_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3421_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3421_Task8" name="Finance capture the recovery (credit posting links to VS-17.1/VS-15.1)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance capture the recovery (credit posting links to VS-17.1/VS-15.1), validate against expectation, and report commodity savings capture to the review (W3416) and vendor scorecard (links to VS-67); feed systemic asymmetry to contract redesign (W3411)
Responsible (R): Finance / Procurement
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3421_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3421_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3421_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3421_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
