Frequency: Periodic + event-driven
Volume: Selected commodity-intensive SKUs
Owner: VP Merchandising
Participants: VP Merchandising, Category Managers, Merchandising Finance (links to VS-101.3), Clearance (links to VS-64/VS-05.3)
Source: workflow W3422 — Commodity-Driven Markdown &amp; Clearance Discipline</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3422_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3422_Lane1" name="Merchandising Finance">
