      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3422_Start4" name="Commodity thesis invalidation (W3410); aged strategic inventory; margin-plan variance…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3422_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3422_Task5" name="Merchandising Finance/Category Managers identify commodity-inventory at risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising Finance/Category Managers identify commodity-inventory at risk: forward-bought stock where the price thesis invalidated (W3410), aged strategic inventory, or commodity price-drop making current cost above market; quantify the markdown exposure vs the markdown budget (links to VS-101 W3285)
Responsible (R): Merchandising Finance / Category Managers
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3422_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3422_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3422_Task6" name="Category Managers/VP Merchandising decide clearance/markdown action within the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers/VP Merchandising decide clearance/markdown action within the markdown budget (links to VS-101 W3285) and authority: clearance event (links to VS-64.2), transfer (links to VS-05.2), vendor return (links to VS-32.2/VS-90), or hold; execute via VS-01.2/VS-64
Responsible (R): Category Managers / VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3422_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3422_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3422_Task7" name="Merchandising Finance track realized markdown vs commodity exposure, attribute…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandising Finance track realized markdown vs commodity exposure, attribute to the commodity decision (W3410), and feed learning to the forward-buy discipline (W3410) and margin analytics (W3419); clear residual per disposition (links to VS-05.3/VS-32.3)
Responsible (R): Merchandising Finance / Category Managers
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3422_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3422_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3422_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3422_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
