      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3423_Task5" name="Treasury/BI publish the commodity-risk dashboard: exposure map (W3401), market…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/BI publish the commodity-risk dashboard: exposure map (W3401), market prices/trend (W3403), sensitivity/VaR (W3404), hedge/mitigation status and MTM (W3412/W3413), pass-through outcome (W3417/W3419), and net margin impact; monthly full + event flash
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / BI / Merchandising Finance
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3423_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3423_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3423_Task6" name="CFO/Treasury/Procurement conduct the monthly commodity-risk review with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO/Treasury/Procurement conduct the monthly commodity-risk review with Merchandising, Finance, and Supply: variance to plan, mitigation effectiveness (W3416), risk/issues, and corrective actions; assign owners and SLAs
Responsible (R): CFO / Treasury / Procurement
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3423_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3423_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3423_Task7" name="CFO report commodity-risk performance and outlook to the executive committee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO report commodity-risk performance and outlook to the executive committee (links to VS-33.2) and Audit Committee/Board (links to VS-36); align with margin/EBITDA narrative (links to VS-101.3/VS-17.4) and ensure disclosure consistency (links to VS-17)
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): Board / Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3423_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3423_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3423_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3423_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
