    <bpmn:process id="W_W3424" name="W3424. Commodity Risk Policy Compliance, Audit &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual policy/audit cycle (links to VS-21/VS-36); post-event review
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: 1 framework, group-wide
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, Treasury Manager, Procurement Director, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Board (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3424 — Commodity Risk Policy Compliance, Audit &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3424_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3424_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3424_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3424_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3424_Lane2" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3424_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3424_Lane3" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3424_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3424_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3424_Start5" name="Annual policy/audit cycle (links to VS-21/VS-36); post-event review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3424_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3424_Task6" name="Treasury/CFO maintain the commodity-risk policy: hedge authority and limits…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/CFO maintain the commodity-risk policy: hedge authority and limits (links to W3406/W3409), indexed-contract standards (W3411), forward-buy/strategic-inventory limits (links to VS-101 OTB), pass-through governance (W3417), and accounting/tax compliance (W3413/links to VS-79); align to ERM (links to VS-21.2) and treasury policy (links to VS-18 W322)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3424_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3424_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3424_Task7" name="Internal Audit review commodity-risk controls: SoD over hedging (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Internal Audit review commodity-risk controls: SoD over hedging (links to W3412/W3413), authority compliance, formula integrity (W3414/W3421), disclosure accuracy, and policy adherence; feed findings to remediation (links to VS-21 issue tracking)
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Risk
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3424_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3424_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3424_Task8" name="CFO/Treasury conduct post-event and continuous-improvement reviews (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO/Treasury conduct post-event and continuous-improvement reviews (links to VS-30 innovation/automation where relevant), capture lessons, update policy/process, and report governance and compliance to the Board (links to VS-36); ensure ongoing alignment with the risk appetite and business strategy
Responsible (R): CFO / Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Board / Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3424_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3424_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3424_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3424_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
