        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-549 (ensure controlled execution — Input-Cost Pass-Through, Margin Protection &amp; Risk Analytics (PA-106.3).) | - operational: SoD, authority limits, and audit; operational: annual review and event triggers
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
